0 Colosseum-Style Arena
0 Name: colosseum_arena.ldr
0 Author: LEGO Designer
0 Closed ring wall, outer 20 x 16 studs, two-stud-thick lower tier with
0 1x4 arches all around, set-back upper tier with smaller 1x3 arches.
0 Tan / dark tan (sand) colours. Arena floor left open. Height 144 LDU.
